ngine/godot/pull/103557.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103557.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-13T14:04:10Z"},"body":"This is required to match GDExtension godot-cpp here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp/blob/master/binding_generator.py#L2102\r\n\r\nThis way, it will be possible for third-party C++ code to be built as both a module and a GDExtension, and query the Godot version with the same code, as long as it's Godot 4.5+ that includes these defines.\r\n\r\nAlso, at least on macOS, these are used by the kernel headers for the kernel version. So if you include both the Godot version header and the macOS kernel version header, the existing defines will conflict.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"720\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-03-04 at 3 04 50 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c817386d-8bcc-4082-bc86-f84fc7b75bc4\" />\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103557/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"tim